ing Opus 5.5 while questioning Claude Code's agent experience</a>, <a href="https://hermes-agent-news.vercel.app/?date=2026-09-24&amp;category=social#item-921e5927b0af" class="internal-link" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub show-and-tell prompts</a>, and short reaction posts rounding out a highly engaged, launch-driven week.</p>]]></content>
